    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nounishpunk is a fast-paced third-person action-adventure game with open-world exploration and skateboarding. Inspired by Sunset Overdrive, Ratchet &amp; Clank, and Batman.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a vibrant futuristic city, fight enemies with ridiculous weapons, and master high-speed movement. No filler, no hand-holding\u2014just pure gameplay. Despite its colorful art style, it\u2019s designed for players who love skill-based action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime: 10-15h</strong>. <strong>Try the demo now!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Exploration:</strong> Roam freely in a lively cyberpunk city filled with missions and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Motorized Skateboarding:</strong> Experience high-speed movement and fluid traversal across the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568760/extras/c582d68cb4dbddd238bfdab27d6b26d9.poster.avif?t=1741768945\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568760/extras/c582d68cb4dbddd238bfdab27d6b26d9.webm?t=1741768945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568760/extras/c582d68cb4dbddd238bfdab27d6b26d9.mp4?t=1741768945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique &amp; Ridiculous Weapons:</strong> Engage in fast-paced combat with a variety of over-the-top weaponry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568760/extras/c83fc3db93f5254610c64f99939e3dad.poster.avif?t=1741768945\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568760/extras/c83fc3db93f5254610c64f99939e3dad.webm?t=1741768945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568760/extras/c83fc3db93f5254610c64f99939e3dad.mp4?t=1741768945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating Futuristic Art Style:</strong> A visually stunning world with a unique sci-fi aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568760/extras/2601eb65a6c0d47d0ee1a1b0a762b629.poster.avif?t=1741768945\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568760/extras/2601eb65a6c0d47d0ee1a1b0a762b629.webm?t=1741768945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568760/extras/2601eb65a6c0d47d0ee1a1b0a762b629.mp4?t=1741768945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> This game is still in development, and features may change before release.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
